  "description": "Castle DynamicProxy based method interception for AutoRegisterDependency. Derive from AbstractInterceptor and declare the target types; sync, async (Task / Task<T>) and ValueTask / ValueTask<T> methods are intercepted, one component still stays one registration and one instance. Interceptor order is declared with [Order]. Brings Castle.Core transitively for AggregateService and Transactional.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
  "id": "AutoRegisterDependency.Extension.Interception",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-11-17T06:41:35.91Z",
